--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14296.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix :meth:`mne.io.Raw.export` to EDF/BDF altering channel values for data originally read from EDF/BDF files, and add a ``digital_range`` parameter to allow preserving the original digital range, by `Daniel McCloy`_.
